---
---

<section class="relative flex flex-col items-center justify-center overflow-hidden px-4 pt-12 pb-20 text-center">
  {/* Aviso Topo */}
  <div class="mt-4 mb-8">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-red-900/50 bg-red-950/40 px-4 py-1.5">
      <span class="h-2 w-2 animate-pulse rounded-full bg-brand-red"></span>
      <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.15em] text-brand-red uppercase">
        Conteúdo Restrito
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>

  {/* Headline Principal - Foco na dor e na curiosidade */}
  <div class="mx-auto mb-10 max-w-4xl space-y-6">
    <h1 class="text-3xl leading-tight font-black tracking-tight text-white md:text-5xl md:leading-[1.1] lg:text-6xl">
      PROJETO DE BAIXO CUSTO QUE GERA <span class="text-brand-red">32CV</span> E FAZ A MOTO PASSAR
      DOS{" "}
      <span class="relative z-10 ml-1 inline-flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-1.5 leading-none text-white italic">
        <span class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 -skew-x-12 rounded-md bg-brand-red"></span>200KM/H
      </span>
    </h1>
    <p class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-lg font-medium text-gray-400 md:text-xl">
      Projetinho diferenciado com pouca cilindrada, simples de fazer e que passa dos 200… assista o
      vídeo antes que saia do ar
    </p>
  </div>

  {/* VSL (Vídeo) */}
  <div class="group relative z-10 mx-auto mb-12 w-full max-w-4xl">
    {/* Efeito visual atrás do vídeo */}
    <div class="absolute -inset-1 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-b from-brand-red to-black opacity-20 blur-2xl transition duration-700 group-hover:opacity-40"></div>

    <div class="relative aspect-video w-full overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-gray-800 bg-[#0a0a0a] shadow-2xl">
      {/* Placeholder para evitar CLS */}
      <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center bg-[#0a0a0a]">
        <div class="flex h-20 w-20 animate-pulse items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-red">
          <svg class="ml-1 h-10 w-10 text-white" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M8 5v14l11-7z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>
      <iframe
        id="panda-5165e69f-f0bd-4929-9fe5-c9dd7b0e2a21"
        src="https://player-vz-8c69785c-727.tv.pandavideo.com.br/embed/?v=5165e69f-f0bd-4929-9fe5-c9dd7b0e2a21"
        style="border:none;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;"
        allow="accelerometer;gyroscope;autoplay;encrypted-media;picture-in-picture"
        allowfullscreen="true"
        width="100%"
        height="100%"
        loading="lazy"
        title="Vídeo de Apresentação"
      >
      </iframe>
    </div>
  </div>

  {/* Botão de Compra - Sem delay para melhor conversão e performance */}
  <div id="hero-cta-container" class="mx-auto w-full max-w-md transition-all duration-1000">
    <a
      href="#oferta"
      class="block w-full transform rounded-lg bg-brand-red px-6 py-5 text-xl font-black tracking-wider text-white uppercase shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(255,51,51,0.3)] transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:bg-brand-red-dark hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(255,51,51,0.5)] md:text-xl"
    >
      GARANTIR VAGA COM DESCONTO
    </a>
    <p class="mt-4 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500">
      <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-green-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
        <path
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          stroke-width="2"
          d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"
        ></path>
      </svg>
      Acesso imediato e seguro
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
